{"t": 1794781486014, "cmd": "note", "args": ["--shot", "stall_flow", "Building the stall was confusing: objective says 'press B inside your settlement'. Pressing E opens the CAMP OF FARMSHIRE panel, but B does nothing there (pressed twice, no message). Only after clicking 'Back' (not 'Exit Settlement') does the in-settlement HUD appear with Build Stall etc., and B works. 'Back' vs 'Exit Settlement' meaning is unclear. In this HUD the Tip 5 popup overlaps the Inventory panel, and the screen is crowded with 13 buttons."]}
